      "description": "FreeDrama – Watch Drama and Earn Cash\n\nWelcome to FreeDrama — your go-to app for drama in short episodes. Stream bite-sized short series, mini series, and reel-style stories made for mobile: fast, emotional, and highly engaging. If you love drama with romance, thrills, twists, and cliffhangers, Drama is for you.\n\nWatch Drama in Minutes\nNo long intros. No filler. Just the best scenes, instantly. On Drama, jump straight into binge-worthy content anytime — during your commute, tea break, or late-night scrolling.\n\nEarn Rewards While You Watch\nEnjoy drama and earn rewards while staying engaged.\n\n* Watch short episodes and collect rewards\n* Complete simple in-app activities to boost earnings\n* Redeem rewards based on options available in India\n  (Reward availability and redemption options may vary by location and eligibility.)\n\nWhat You'll Find on Drama\nDiscover a fast-growing library of short entertainment:\n\n* Short Series & Mini Series: episodes under 2 minutes\n* Trending Reels: viral drama moments and popular scenes\n* Exclusive Originals: fresh stories you won't find elsewhere\n\nGenres for Every Mood\nFind your next obsession across top categories:\n\n* Romance and Love Stories\n* Emotional Drama\n* Thriller and Suspense\n* Action and Revenge\n* Family and Relationships\n* College and Youth Stories\n\nThere’s always something new waiting on Drama.\n\nFeatures You'll Love\n\n* Instant Play for smooth streaming on mobile networks\n* Personalized Feed with smart recommendations\n* Easy Sharing to share your favorite content\n\nDownload Drama Now\nJoin viewers across India discovering creators, rating stories, saving favorites, and binge-watching short episodes every day. Download Drama now and start watching anytime, anywhere.\n\nTerms and Conditions: https://freedrama.app/terms-condition\nPrivacy Policy: https://freedrama.app/privacy-policy",
